@host = http://localhost:5207

### List (page 1, 10 per halaman)
GET {{host}}/api/Categories/GetRows
Accept: application/json

### List + search + paging
GET {{host}}/api/Categories/GetRows?page=1&pageSize=5&search=sea
Accept: application/json

### Detail
GET {{host}}/api/Categories/GetRow/1
Accept: application/json

### Insert (CategoryId 0 = id dibuat otomatis)
POST {{host}}/api/Categories/Insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 0,
  "categoryName": "Snacks",
  "description": "Chips dan kacang"
}

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/Categories/Update/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 0,
  "categoryName": "Snacks",
  "description": "Chips, kacang, dan biskuit"
}

### Delete (semua id harus ada, kalau tidak → 404 dan tidak ada yang terhapus)
DELETE {{host}}/api/Categories/Delete?ids=9
Accept: application/json
